  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  HCODX PREVIEW CONTROLLER / BROKER — preview.hcodx.io/index.html
  VERSION: 5.0.0
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (editor audit isolation fix):
    The previous preview shell ran the privileged controller AND the
    untrusted previewed project on the SAME origin (preview.hcodx.io) with
    `allow-same-origin`, so project code could seize the shell's realm, rewrite
    its DOM, wipe the shared cache, and forge messages that looked like they
    came from the trusted shell to the editor. See HCODX/EDITOR-PRODUCTION-AUDIT.md.

  WHAT THIS FILE IS NOW:
    A thin, origin-gated BROKER. It holds no service worker, no cache, and no
    project code. It embeds the render engine CROSS-ORIGIN
    (https://sbx.hcodx.io/render.html) and relays postMessages between:
      • the editor (https://hcodx.io)  — the parent/opener that controls it, and
      • the render engine (https://sbx.hcodx.io) — its one child iframe.
    It forwards messages verbatim; all protocol logic lives in the editor
    connector and in render.html. Because previewed project code now lives on
    sbx.hcodx.io, it is cross-origin to this broker and to the editor, so its
    forged messages carry the wrong origin and are rejected at every hop.

  TRUST GATES (both directions, origin AND source checked):
    editor → broker : e.origin === EDITOR_ORIGIN && isTrustedController(e.source)
                      → forwarded DOWN to the render frame.
    render → broker : e.origin === RENDER_ORIGIN && e.source === renderFrame.contentWindow
                      → forwarded UP to the editor (parent + opener).
    A message from the previewed project (origin sbx.hcodx.io, but
    e.source is the project window, not renderFrame.contentWindow) fails the
    source check here, and additionally fails the editor connector's own
    `e.origin === preview.hcodx.io` check. No Cloudflare Worker is involved.
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
