  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  HCODX PREVIEW BOOT FRAME  — sbx.hcodx.io/boot.html
  VERSION: 1.1.0  (cross-origin render isolation)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  PURPOSE:
    Fast-path first render. Loaded as the initial inner frame by
    render.html (the render engine, same render origin). Immediately
    sends HCODX_BOOT_HELLO to it so it can respond with the bootstrap payload
    (entry HTML + critical CSS + critical JS) before the Service
    Worker is active.

  FLOW:
    1. Boot frame loads → sends HCODX_BOOT_HELLO to parent shell.
    2. Shell replies with HCODX_BOOT_READY { html, entryPath }.
    3. Boot frame writes html via document.open/write/close,
       achieving first visible paint in 120–250 ms.
    4. Shell registers the SW in the background.
    5. Once SW is active + cache written, shell replaces inner.src
       with the real /preview/{sid}/{rev}/{path} URL (seamless).
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
